  "caption": "‼️ INFORMASI PENTING: PENGALIHAN LALU LINTAS CK RUN 2026\n\nKami informasikan bahwa aktivitas Anda akan sedikit terganggu pada Minggu, 2 Agustus 2026, pukul 05.00 - 08.00 WITA karena adanya event CIRCLE K RUN 2026.\n\nDimohon untuk MENGHINDARI ruas jalan berikut demi kelancaran bersama:\n(Daftar jalan selengkapnya dapat dilihat pada gambar)\n\nMohon maaf atas ketidaknyamanannya dan terima kasih banyak atas pengertian Anda! 🙏\n\n#CKRun2026 #InfoLalin #Bali #RoadClosure #CircleK\n\n—\n\n‼️ IMPORTANT NOTICE: CK RUN 2026 TRAFFIC DISRUPTION\n\nPlease be advised that traffic and daily activities will be affected on Sunday, August 2, 2026, from 05:00 AM to 08:00 AM WITA due to the CIRCLE K RUN 2026 event.\n\nWe kindly request commuters to AVOID the roads listed in the image to ensure a smooth journey.\n\nWe deeply apologize for the inconvenience and highly appreciate your understanding! 🙏\n\n@circlekrun_id \n\nCKRun2026 TrafficInfo Bali RoadClosure",
